EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hi {!Price_Book_Approval__c.OwnerFullName},
Your request for {!Price_Book_Approval__c.Name} has been {!ApprovalRequest.Status}.
If your request has been approved, then you're good to go. The selected price book will be sent to all approved accounts according to their respective email days.
If your request was rejected, please review the comments below to address any issues and resubmit.
Comments: {!ApprovalRequest.Comments}
Thanks, {!ApprovalRequest.Process_Approver}
